            <li>What is that mask field currently set to in the Inspector? Not what you intended — what is actually ticked in the dropdown.</li>
            <li>If the mask is set to <strong>Default</strong> or <strong>Everything</strong> instead of <code>Ground</code>, what is the ray allowed to answer for? Name the two solid surfaces in this cave that a <code>Ground</code> mask includes and a <code>Default</code> mask does not — and say which of the two you would have forgotten to put in the bucket.</li>
